{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"tl-v1","tool":"ragflow_retrieval","arguments":{"dataset_ids":["74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37"],"metadata_condition":{"logic":"and","conditions":[{"name":"path","comparison_operator":"is","value":"sources"}]},"page_size":10,"vector_similarity_weight":0.3,"similarity_threshold":0.2,"top_k":1024,"keyword":false,"question":"opentelemetry-go-contrib pull 8386 issue 7254 otelhttp RecordError resolution merged implementation v1.40.0"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"chunks\": [{\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-ISSUE-02]\\n\\n# Issue: otelhttp: Cannot record error for spans when producing new semantic convention (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib#7254)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/7254  \\n\\n**Author**: XSAM  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-04-23T02:21:22Z · **Updated**: 2026-01-13T15:23:09Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: closed (completed)  \\n\\n**Labels**: bug, area: instrumentation, instrumentation: otelhttp  \\n\\n**Milestone**: v1.40.0\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n### Description\\n\\n`otelhttp` only uses `span.RecordError(err)` when `errType` is not empty\\n\\nhttps://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/blob/b8572491f2d143672581d1c51693c928d376dff8/instrumentation/net/http/otelhttp/transport.go#L132-L140\\n\\nBut `ErrorType` method never returns an empty attribute.\\n\\nhttps://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/blob/b8572491f2d143672581d1c51693c928d376dff8/instrumentation/net/http/httptrace/otelhttptrace/internal/semconv/httpconv.go#L443-L458\\n\\n### Expected behavior\\n\\nI don't have a preference on whether we should record `error.type` with `exception.type` at the same time. But the comment and the logic here seem conflicted. \\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-ISSUE-02]\\n\\n# Issue: otelhttp: Cannot record error for spans when producing new semantic convention (open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib#7254)\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-contrib/issues/7254  \\n\\n**Author**: XSAM  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-04-23T02:21:22Z · **Updated**: 2026-01-13T15:23:09Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z  \\n\\n**State**: closed (completed)  \\n\\n**Labels**: bug, area: instrumentation, instrumentation: otelhttp  \\n\\n**Milestone**: v1.40.0\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Discussion (15)\\n\\n**dmathieu** — 2025-04-23T08:03:12Z\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src issu 02 issu otelhttp can not record error for span when produc new semant convent open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib 7254 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 7254 author xsam creat 2025 04 23t02 21 22z updat 2026 01 13t15 23 09z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state close complet label bug area instrument instrument otelhttp mileston v1 400 descript descript otelhttp onli us span recorderror err when errtyp is not empti http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib blob b8572491f2d143672581d1c51693c928d376dff8 instrument net http otelhttp transport go l132 l140 but errortyp method never return an empti attribut http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib blob b8572491f2d143672581d1c51693c928d376dff8 instrument net http httptrace otelhttptrac intern semconv httpconv go l443 l458 expect behavior i don t have a prefer on whether we should record error type with except type at the same time but the comment and the logic here seem conflict sourc id src issu 02 issu otelhttp can not record error for span when produc new semant convent open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib 7254 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go contrib issu 7254 author xsam creat 2025 04 23t02 21 22z updat 2026 01 13t15 23 09z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z state close complet label bug area instrument instrument otelhttp mileston v1 400 discuss 15 dmathieu 2025 04 23t08 03 12z\", \